; A wild dragon is an animal, and it fights like one: it does not gain new tricks as it is hurt, it
; simply gets faster and less careful. Escalation only — the first fight that proves a boss needs no
; ability set to be a boss.
;
; The 150 s fuse is short because this is the smallest of the three and the fight should not become a
; war of attrition against a health pool.
